sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Player
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as FastAPI
  participant E as ElevenLabs Speech Engine
  participant G as Groq
  P->>B: clicks Start live voice
  B->>S: GET api speech-engine token for SARA
  S->>E: get_webrtc_token for the Sara engine id
  S-->>B: conversation token
  B->>E: Conversation.startSession over WebRTC
  E->>S: opens wss ws sara with signed JWT header
  S->>S: verify_speech_engine_jwt then ws.accept
  B->>E: player speaks, mic audio over WebRTC
  E->>S: transcript delivered to on_transcript
  S->>G: llama 3.3 70b streaming with Sara prompt
  G-->>S: reply tokens
  S-->>E: session.send_response streams the reply
  E-->>B: Sara voice audio plus agent message
  B->>B: onModeChange plays video, onMessage logs the line
